Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:37.10,H_fil,,0,0,0,,Nag-sabwatan ang mga kalaban... pero naalala niya lahat
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:37.10,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Maraming tao
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:02.41,S_fil,,0,0,0,,hinusgahan si Song Jingyi sa forum — walang boundaries daw.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.69,0:00:04.30,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Hindi totoo 'yan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.34,0:00:05.98,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Walang mali sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:07.82,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Biruan lang, pwede na makipag-flirt sa boyfriend ng iba?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:09.02,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Itinuring ni Mi Ke na best friend siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:09.96,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Eh siya,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:10.98,S_fil,,0,0,0,,nagkalat naman sa likod niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.02,0:00:11.98,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Walang boundaries,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:13.06,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ganoon kakampi-sarili?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:14.38,S_fil,,0,0,0,,boyfriend ng iba kayang landiin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.42,0:00:15.32,S_fil,,0,0,0,,tapos nagpapanggap pa na inosente?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:18.06,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Si Song Jingyi, mukhang dalisay,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:20.06,S_fil,,0,0,0,,yun pala sa likod, kalat na kalat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:22.02,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Si Jiang Muyi namang tinanggihan ni Jingyi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:23.42,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ay lumabas sa moment na 'to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.78,S_fil,,0,0,0,,at tinanggap lahat ng batikos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:26.58,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Mabait naman sina Mi Ke at Jingyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:28.23,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ako ang may kasalanan lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.27,0:00:29.31,S_fil,,0,0,0,,At ako—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:30.87,S_fil,,0,0,0,,hindi lang ako nakatapak kay Jiang Muyi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.91,0:00:32.39,S_fil,,0,0,0,,lumabas sa pinakababang antas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:33.47,S_fil,,0,0,0,,at bumagsak nang matino
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:34.67,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ang reputasyon ni Jingyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:35.63,S_fil,,0,0,0,,di ba't 'yun na
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.67,0:00:37.10,S_fil,,0,0,0,,maliit na tagumpay?
